{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0016"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge film-media/animation","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/film-media__animation.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",188],["-","Feature;"],["+","Feature"],["=",1],["+","in March 2003, the first Japanese animated film ever to win an Oscar; "],["=",614],["+","In that first film the cheese-loving inventor Wallace (of Wallace & Gromit) builds a rocket in his cellar and flies to the moon with his four-legged friend, because, as he tells Gromit, \"everybody knows the moon's made of cheese\". "],["=",245]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",182],["+","im März 2003 "],["=",10],["-","Animationsfilm;"],["+","Animationsfilm"],["=",1],["+","– als erster japanischer Zeichentrickfilm überhaupt, der einen Oscar erhielt; "],["=",582],["+","In diesem ersten Film baut der käseverliebte Erfinder Wallace (aus Wallace & Gromit) im Keller eine Rakete und fliegt mit seinem vierbeinigen Freund zum Mond, denn, so erklärt er Gromit: „Jeder weiß, dass der Mond aus Käse ist.“ "],["=",233]]}]},
